# Prior Art

Builds upon concepts and techniques established by these tools:

- [Ligolo-ng](https://github.com/nicocha30/ligolo-ng) — Tunneling tool using a TUN interface.
- [Chisel](https://github.com/jpillora/chisel) — Fast TCP/UDP tunnel over HTTP.
- [Proxychains](https://github.com/haad/proxychains) — Hook preloader for routing connections through proxies.
